file of its own — neither in the crates.io package nor in the GitHub
repository (https://github.com/jrmuizel/pdf-extract), which declares its
license solely via `license = "MIT"` in Cargo.toml. This file reproduces
the standard MIT License text so the notice travels with the vendored
source in this repository, with the copyright holder taken from the
crate's own `authors` field. It is not a verbatim copy of an upstream
file, because no such file exists.

See ./README.md for what was patched in this vendored copy and why.

